					"globalShare:1": 0,
					"desc:8": "This multiblock works just like a normal drilling rig, but with the power of §5§l§oTechnology§r it won't reduce the underground field size, so the output will always be the same. Additionally, you won't require any of those pesky mining pipes anymore!\n\nRequires a §4§nUHV+§r tier energy hatch in order to function.\n\nGrants §6§l2§r parallels per energy hatch tier above §4§nUHV§r.\n\n[note]Glass tier does not matter![/note]",
