					"desc:8": "So far, cutting Atto Power ICs in the HILE is really terrible, the lasers are just way too powerful to cut them effectively. Fortunately for you, you have the insane crushing power of black holes!\n\nBy compressing a Spatially Transcendent Gravitational Lens Block with some Spatially Enlarged Fluid, you can forge a very powerful lens. A lens so effective, it can bend light and even space.\n\nMaybe don't put your eyes up to the glass.\n\n[note]This lens unlocks a 1-2 recipe for Atto Power ICs, don't forget to repattern![/note]",
					"notification_icon_scale:5": -1.0,
					"notification_show_icon:8": "default",
					"notification_fade_in:5": -1.0,
