					"autoClaim:1": 0,
					"globalShare:1": 0,
					"desc:8": "Before going any further you really should craft a lot,[note] and I mean a lot[/note], of crop sticks. Hope you like chopping trees and crafting saws! §o§oYou should've seen the old recipe...\n\n§o§rEach of the adjacent quest groupings represent a different category of crops found within the mod. If you haven't yet, I would highly recommend you review the in depth guide quests focusing on [warn]Crop Stats[/warn] and [warn]Crop Nutrients[/warn].\n\nWhile not every crop will produce a useful harvest, they very well may deterministically breed into a useful crop or open up a useful pool. So don't throw away new species just because they don't seem immediately useful.\n\nCertain crops need more than just two parents to breed. For those crops, simply surround a single double cropstick with all 3-4 crops needed and continue as normal.\n\n[note]Be free farmhand~![/note]",
					"notification_icon_scale:5": -1.0,
					"notification_show_icon:8": "default",
					"notification_fade_in:5": -1.0,
