					"autoClaim:1": 0,
					"globalShare:1": 0,
					"desc:8": "The Rainmaker is a Forestry block capable of stopping/producing rain & creating thunderstorms.\n\nThe Rainmaker has no GUI, but can be right clicked with §a3§r different capsules:\n\n§cIodine Capsule:§r Produces Rain\n\n§cPhosphoric Iodine Capsule:§r Produces a Thunderstorm\n\n§cDissipation Charge:§r Stops Rain\n\nThe Rainmaker requires around ~30 seconds after activation for the §9rain§r and §9thunderstorm§r to start.\n\nThe dissipation charge will stop the rain after a few seconds until the next activation. ",
