					"autoClaim:1": 0,
					"globalShare:1": 0,
					"desc:8": "With the creation of the Black Hole Compressor, three different paths have opened up.\n\nThe Top Path: The Bose-Einstein Multiblocks\nA suite of multiblocks for late game assembly.\n\n[note]This path makes the other two paths faster and cheaper.[/note]\n\nThe Middle Path: Antimatter\nA fancy new power generation method to keep up with rising EU costs.\n\n[note]This path makes the other two paths easier to scale by giving you more power to burn.[/note]\n\nThe Bottom Path: The Forge of the Gods\nThe largest multiblock, capable of smelting everything you could ever want.\n\n[note]This path makes the other two paths faster by speeding up ingot smelting.[/note]",
