					"autoClaim:1": 0,
					"globalShare:1": 0,
					"desc:8": "Having too much normal warp? Sanitizing Soap is too expensive for you?\n\nWell, luckily for you, you can remove your Warp using a Silverwood Smoking Pipe and some Relaxing Tobacco. This is a fairly cheap and sustainable option for removing your Normal warp (assuming you have a good option to get a lot of Vis).\n\nIt also has a chance to reduce your temporary warp.\n\n[note]The chance to reduce your normal warp per Relaxing Tobacco is 10%, so you'll be needing a bunch of it.[/note]",
