					"autoClaim:1": 0,
					"globalShare:1": 0,
					"desc:8": "Finally, a cool looking tank! It can store up to §932,000 L§r, just like the Ultra Low Voltage Fluid Tank or Large Aluminium Fluid Cell, and comes with some nice QoL features:\n\n- They stack up to 64 items per slot, making it possible to store §92,048,000 L§r in a single slot!\n\n- Tanks can be placed on top of each other to form a connected tower. When filling higher tanks, the fluid will automatically flow down. You can also drain fluid from higher tanks even if the fluid is only stored in tanks below.\n\n- You can use an §lEmpty Cell§r, a §lLarge Fluid Cell§r or any other §lfluid container§r to fill or drain a tank on right click. If the fluid container in your hand is not empty, right-click will always try to fill the tank from it.\n\n[warn]Note: The tank keeps its contents only when shift-right-clicked with a wrench. \nBreaking it with a pickaxe will void the stored fluid.[/warn]",
					"notification_icon_scale:5": -1.0,
					"notification_show_icon:8": "default",
					"notification_fade_in:5": -1.0,
