					"autoClaim:1": 0,
					"globalShare:1": 0,
					"desc:8": "These bad boys are the most advanced species you can imagine. Improving its stats requires extensive technological investments, and they take extremely long to produce their harvest.\n\n[note]Since the primordial berry cannot be bred from other crops, you'll need to use a primordial pearl as a seed to get your first seedling.[/note]\n\n[warn]Water, fertilizer and sky access alone won't cut it for this crop, you'll need at least 1 biome tag or a high humidity biome or else your crop will get sick.[/warn]\n\n[warn]This crop cannot spread or breed with other crops, so if you want to stat it up, you'll need to use a Crop Gene Extractor and a Crop Synthesizer.[/warn]",
