					"globalShare:1": 1,
					"desc:8": "Now that you've gotten your tools and are about to go collect a bunch of stuff, it's time to make some storage for it.\nTake some of your wood, and craft a chest. You will need 4 wood, 4 planks, and 1 flint.",
