					"autoClaim:1": 0,
					"globalShare:1": 1,
					"desc:8": "You won't always get food rewards from the quests, so it might be a good idea to take care of that problem.\n\nAs you've crafted a hoe already, go and find some water nearby to make a field. With this modpack you can only make farmland within range of water. Let's trade some sticks for a carrot, so you can start your own farm.\n\nTo get other wheat, use a hoe on grass away from water. You'll get Witchery seeds too - save those for later.\n\nStart planting a Cotton field because it's a key early-game resource.\n\nYou can also get seeds from villages, and grow the seeds from the Pam's garden food.",
					"notification_icon_scale:5": -1.0,
					"notification_show_icon:8": "default",
					"notification_fade_in:5": -1.0,
