					"autoClaim:1": 0,
					"globalShare:1": 1,
					"desc:8": "Iron can be found in multiple veins, and there are many types of ores that will smelt down into iron ingots such as magnetite, brown / yellow limonite, banded iron, roasted iron, and granitic / basaltic mineral sand.\n\n§lIron-Rich Veins:\n§rMagnetite veins (Y 60-180)\nChalcopyrite veins (Y 5-60) \nGold veins (Y 30-60)\nLimonite veins (Y 10-40)\n\n[note]You can use NEI to see information for all of the ore veins in the game![/note]",
