					"particle_count:3": -1,
					"countAsQuest:1": 1,
					"autoClaim:1": 0,
					"globalShare:1": 1,
					"desc:8": "Fertilizer is a foundational resource to produce and consume when farming. It has two key uses:\n\nFirst, it speeds up crop growth by boosting the nutrient score.\n\nSecond, it prevents stat loss during crop breeding. This simply prevents stat loss; it doesn't increase the likelihood of a stat increase.\n\nFour separate items can be used to apply fertilizer to your crops, each providing a different amount of fertilizer points:\n\n- Crops NH Fertilizer: 100 points\n- Forestry Compost: 50 points\n- Forestry Fertilizer: 25 points\n- Bone Meal: 5 points\n\n[note]While Bone Meal may seem weak, its ability to still prevent stat loss when breeding is key if you intend to start crops before you can make a Chemical Reactor.[/note]\n\nThe Crop Managers and the Industrial Farm both also accept liquid fertilizers. There are currently two of them:\n\n- Fertilizer: 1 point per L\n- Enriched Fertilizer: 10 points per L",
					"notification_icon_scale:5": -1.0,
					"notification_show_icon:8": "default",
					"notification_fade_in:5": -1.0,
					"icon:10": {
						"id:8": "cropsnh:fertilizer",
