					"countAsQuest:1": 1,
					"autoClaim:1": 0,
					"globalShare:1": 1,
					"desc:8": "You've been using Steam, Creosote, or possibly Oil to generate power. It's time to start making Bio Diesel. The first step is to make Plantballs out of organic materials. You can use Wheat, Sugar Canes, Apples, Saplings or, well, practically anything. All CropsNH crops are 4:1 instead of an 8:1 ratio. Realistically, you'll probably just use saplings though, since you'll want/need a tree farm anyway.\n\nBe sure you have a Forestry Multifarm, Steve's Carts Farm, CropsNH Crop Sticks with a Crop Manager, or whatever, because you need plenty of bio materials for constant Bio Diesel production.",
