					"autoClaim:1": 0,
					"globalShare:1": 1,
					"desc:8": "I know you've been after this for a while...\n\nNow that you've hit MV tier, it's time to get a better ratio when making rods, gears, and rings. Most extruder recipes use more than 32 EU/t so you need an MV extruder. After crafting the machine you need extruder shapes for the different types of parts you will want to make.\n\nThere are a few more shapes than the ones listed here. Make sure to have a look.\n\n[note]Most of the Tinkers Gregworks tool parts are made in the extruder. They also have long extrusion times to balance out their usefulness.[/note]",
