					"globalShare:1": 1,
					"desc:8": "Out of princesses to inject traits to? Too lazy to find hives and get more bees? Not a problem. With this nifty little device, you can use a ton of power, liquid DNA and protein to create any bee you wish to have. The only drawback is: All bees will be ignoble, which means they will die after a random amount of cycles after 90.\n\nOf course, there's an upgrade for the industrial apiary to deal with that",
