					"particle_count:3": -1,
					"countAsQuest:1": 1,
					"autoClaim:1": 0,
					"globalShare:1": 1,
					"desc:8": "There are a number of chemical recipes that are unlocked with an §5HV Chemical Reactor§r; you will finally be able to make Ender Eyes, Ammonia, Gelled Toluene, and plenty of other useful components. \n\nAlternatively, if you're up for it, you can head over to the Mass Processing tab and build yourself a §5Large Chemical Reactor§r (LCR) instead! In addition to having a more efficient overclock, the LCR can input multiple liquids so you won't need to mess with those pesky cells any longer. \n\n[note]If you choose to go the LCR route, be sure to take a look at the PTFE questline just ahead of this one, starting with \"Teflon Don\".[/note]\n\n[note]P.S. You can skip any of the following rubber/plastic questlines by holding 128 of the respective sheets in your hand![/note]",
