					"autoClaim:1": 0,
					"globalShare:1": 1,
					"desc:8": "It's upgrade time again. You can make Obzinite by mixing obsidian, steel, and zinc in the smeltery. Obzinite pickaxes are able to mine ardite in the Nether.\n\nLeave the rest of your Obzinite as liquid in your smeltery; you'll want it to make the Tool Forge. You need 16 ingots in the smeltery to make 2 Large Plates.\n\n[note]Later in LV you can get a better yield by using a Mixer.[/note]",
					"notification_icon_scale:5": -1.0,
					"notification_show_icon:8": "default",
