					"autoClaim:1": 0,
					"globalShare:1": 1,
					"desc:8": "While one reactor is nice and all, why not make another? This time you can use the MK3 americium recipe to make it easier.\n\nCosting just 1 ingot of Plutonium, and 2 cells of hydrogen, this recipe is much easier and faster than the MK2 version. By making americium plasma, then putting it through a turbine, you will get americium in the liquid state. You will need at least 132 plates for the controller and the fusion machine casings.\n\nPlus, free power!",
