					"globalShare:1": 1,
					"desc:8": "To make a mk2 reactor, ender quarry, T5 rocket, unlock ZPM, or other things, you will need europium. Once you make a t5 rocket you will be able to find this as part of a very rare ore. Until then you need to produce it in the reactor. But it's probably not worth it to look for the ore anyway.\n\n[note]Now that you have produced europium, you can process the Europium III Oxide from your Monaline if you built one.[/note]",
